{"3899920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Recycling Shift", "steam_appid": 3899920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist &amp; Play the demo first! ✨</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/63973a1e40e57b7f956f5aa9d515fea9.avif?t=1783587954\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Welcome to the Recycling Shift, where one person’s trash is your next paycheck.</strong><br><br>Recycling Shift is a cozy, tactile job simulator where you work at a bustling recycling facility. With items flying in on the conveyor belt, it’s your job to sort, salvage, and maybe even sneak a few valuables out for a little side hustle on the black market.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8a4fd03ac54f59dd45382ec1a6f38bf7.poster.avif?t=1783587954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8a4fd03ac54f59dd45382ec1a6f38bf7.webm?t=1783587954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8a4fd03ac54f59dd45382ec1a6f38bf7.mp4?t=1783587954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From plastic bottles to worn-out electronics, every shift is a hands-on experience. Pick through the mess, tidy up the planet, and upgrade your setup to become the most efficient sorter the world’s ever seen.<br><br><strong>♻️ Core Gameplay</strong><br>• Drag and drop discarded items into the correct bins: Glass, Paper, Metal, Plastic, Textiles, Batteries, and Electronics.  <br>• Watch out for biodegradable scraps too, compost them to earn bonus eco-points.  <br>• Sell rare or valuable junk to earn extra cash on the side... just don’t get caught.<br><br><strong>🛠️ Mini-Games &amp; Maintenance</strong><br>• Keep the machines humming with interactive minigames: tighten bolts, clean filters, align gears, reconnect wires, and more. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/d3a27054eff01f7adb5a85f28e092a08.poster.avif?t=1783587954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/d3a27054eff01f7adb5a85f28e092a08.webm?t=1783587954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/d3a27054eff01f7adb5a85f28e092a08.mp4?t=1783587954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>🌞 Day &amp; Night Shifts</strong><br>• Clock in for different shifts and face changing item types, speeds, and challenges.  <br>• Night shifts might just bring some... <i>unusual</i> materials.<br><br><strong>🌍 Eco-Impact System</strong><br>• Track your progress with the Eco-Impact Meter. Feel good knowing your work makes a difference (and maybe earns a bonus too).  <br>• Avoid contamination by staying sharp, trash in the wrong bin ruins your streak!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8b9d6322b0b706cc0c97605ecc45e23b.poster.avif?t=1783587954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8b9d6322b0b706cc0c97605ecc45e23b.webm?t=1783587954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8b9d6322b0b706cc0c97605ecc45e23b.mp4?t=1783587954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>💼 Upgrade &amp; Expand</strong><br>• Earn money to unlock better tools, faster machines, and smarter sorting tech.  <br>• Turn your humble work station into a streamlined recycling empire.<br><br><strong>Trash or treasure? It's all in a day's shift.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/63973a1e40e57b7f956f5aa9d515fea9.avif?t=1783587954\" width=1560 height=460 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to the Recycling Shift, where one person’s trash is your next paycheck.</strong><br><br>Recycling Shift is a cozy, tactile job simulator where you work at a bustling recycling facility. With items flying in on the conveyor belt, it’s your job to sort, salvage, and maybe even sneak a few valuables out for a little side hustle on the black market.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8a4fd03ac54f59dd45382ec1a6f38bf7.poster.avif?t=1783587954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8a4fd03ac54f59dd45382ec1a6f38bf7.webm?t=1783587954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899920/extras/8a4fd03ac54f59dd45382ec1a6f38bf7.mp4?t=1783587954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From plastic bottles to worn-out electronics, every shift is a hands-on experience. Pick through the mess, tidy up the planet, and upgrade your setup to become the most efficient sorter the world’s ever seen.<br><br><strong>♻️ Core Gameplay</strong><br>• Drag and drop discarded items into the correct bins: Glass, Paper, Metal, Plastic, Textiles, Batteries, and Electronics.  <br>• Watch out for biodegradable scraps too, compost them to earn bonus eco-points.  <br>• Sell rare or valuable junk to earn extra cash on the side... just don’t get cau